						 <p>I immediatly upvoted this entry because of the amazing joke in the title, but I would say that it doesn´t really make sense for an omnipotent being to borrow money. Couldn´t he just create some or make his cult &quot;sacrifice&quot; theirs? I also think you got a bit too ceinformal in the discovery, at least the sentence &quot;gave him a few bucks for a cab&quot;. That being said, I still had to laugh the entire time and the voicemails were a great touch. Overall amazing.</p> 
				 	]]>
