				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2258140#post-2872865</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2258140/cimmerian-kaktus-proposal#post-2872865</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 19 Jun 2017 16:20:05 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Weryllium</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2727655</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's possible that this person considers the 'omnipotence' and subsequent incompetence a jab at God's expense, or else at another important deity figure described as 'omnipotent'.</p> <p>That said, two points. 1) As a religious person myself, I've learned to mentally distance what's written here and remind myself that it's all just fiction. 2) Just because someone <em>can</em> do something, doesn't mean they have the motivation or will to actually <em>do</em> it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
